  "label": "Foreign Infiltrator Trope",
  "description": "A racist and Islamophobic stereotype that falsely accuses individuals of being foreign agents or traitors who have infiltrated a society or institution. This trope is often used to delegitimize political figures based on their ethnicity, religion, or national origin, and is frequently weaponized against Muslim, Asian, and other minority groups. In this meme, it is used to imply that the featured Muslim women politicians are disloyal to the United States.",
